        "githubCommitMessage": "feat(duels): real seat avatars across match views; mini-golf replay fix + resign\n\nEvery 1v1 board now identifies both seats by their actual profile picture and\nusername (or the GRYND mark for the bot) through a shared SeatAvatar fed by the\nplatform's seat-identity resolver — mini-golf, solitaire-duel, sudoku-duel,\ntic-tac-toe and speed-typing, with the speed-typing snapshot carrying the\nidentities alongside the match DTO.\n\nIn mini-golf, the practice bot resolves its whole turn in one poll but only its\nlast shot was animated, so its ball jumped across obstacles to the final stroke's\nstart. The view now replays the whole turn as one continuous trajectory built\nfrom the authoritative shot log, and the concede control reads \"Resign\" and stays\nvisible on mobile.\n\nAlso lands the in-flight solitaire-duel restart/solvability work, the shared site\nURL helper, and the matching tests and docs.\n\n🤖 Generated with Codebuff\nCo-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>",
