        "githubCommitMessage": "feat: duel practice bots, one-click email unsubscribe, leaderboard integrity\n\nShip free play-vs-AI opponents for Mines PvP (the bot now deduces and flags\nmines instead of only revealing) and Sudoku Duel (a solver-derived bot paced\nfrom the server clock), pace the mini-golf AI so its hole and final-result\npopups settle after the turn instead of snapping in, and make every marketing\nemail one-click unsubscribable via a signed link plus RFC 8058 headers with an\ni18n'd confirmation page and an email_events audit row.\n\nStop hand-seeded stats from ranking: the boards now skip rows whose W/L record\nexceeds the games the account actually recorded, an invariant only\napplyLeaderboardCounters can satisfy. The tester-purge script gains explicit\ntargeting, stronger patterns, and a bot-account exclusion.\n\n🤖 Generated with Codebuff\nCo-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>",
