        "githubCommitMessage": "feat(sudoku-duel): add the rated 1v1 Sudoku Duel game\n\nAdd a server-authoritative 1v1 Sudoku race: one seeded puzzle is solved by both\nseats and judged against the server's own board, reusing the platform's existing\nmatchmaking, countdown, timeout tiebreaks, forfeit/disconnect and\nrating/trophy settlement seams. Ships the puzzle engine, authoritative store,\nAPI routes, realtime room wiring, lobby and match UI, and the\nengine/rules/store/security test suites.\n\nIncludes the end-to-end polish pass: the lobby now lists open lobbies from its\nown /available route and the shared lobby room, a cancelled match no longer\nrenders the game shell behind its card, and the result duration is anchored to\nthe server's GO instant.\n\n🤖 Generated with Codebuff\nCo-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>",
